      "description": "The meme uses racialized commentary and welfare dependency tropes to frame the Black child as a symbol of poverty and the white woman as a privileged outsider, potentially reinforcing damaging societal narratives about Black communities being 'welfare dependent' or lazy. This framing risks perpetuating harmful stereotypes and contributing to negative perceptions of Black economic circumstances.",
